                        "email": "christopher.meis@gmx.de",
                        "username": "ChriMarMe"
                    },
                    "message": "IIUC this fixes an issue with a datastructure, which has a malformed smbios table type 0 on one specific machine. \n\nWhy isn't it possible to fix the datastructure itself?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Tan Siewert",
                        "email": "tan@siewert.io",
                        "username": "sinuscosinustan"
                    },
                    "message": "The UEFI is proprietary (HPE) and not in our responsibility. The bug was reported to them but it may take a bit until they fix it. Further that, a user may want to run an older UEFI version for compatibility reasons, meaning we'd still need the fix."
                }
            ],
